<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Group lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allied Group lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said Monday it had cut its rating on Allied Group Inc to maintain from accumulate, based on valuation.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The downgrade was based purely on price considerations,&quot; analyst Steve Musser said. &quot;The shares were a bit overdone...The long-term fundamentals are still in place.</p>
<p>-- Musser said he raised his 1998 earnings estimate on the company to $3.40 a share from $3.35.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3-3/16 to 46-1/16.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk))</p>
